# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in your real key.
# ".env" is git-ignored, so your key is never committed.
#
# How to get a Claude API key (free ~5$ credits on signup):
#   1. Go to https://console.anthropic.com/
#   2. Sign up / log in
#   3. Open "API Keys" in the left sidebar
#   4. Click "Create Key" and copy it
#   5. Paste it below, after the "="
#
# This key powers the AI features only (ETF analysis, journal insights,
# DCA market context). Everything else in the app works without it.
VITE_ANTHROPIC_KEY=
